T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* 1. Arithmetic Operators: Addition \(+\), Subtraction \(-\), Multiplication \(*\), True) Tj
T*
(Division \(/ yields float\), Floor Division \(// truncates towards negative infinity\),) Tj
T*
(Modulus \(% remainder\), Exponentiation \(**\).) Tj
T*
(* 2. Relational / Comparison Operators: Equal \(==\), Not Equal \(!=\), Greater Than \(>\),) Tj
T*
(Less Than \(<\), Greater/Equal \(>=\), Less/Equal \(<=\). Can be chained: 0 <= x < 10.) Tj
T*
