([PROGRAM 1: AC Electrical Power and Complex Impedance Calculator]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Context: Calculate real power, reactive power, apparent power, and power factor) Tj
T*
(for an alternating current circuit given voltage V_rms, current I_rms, and phase angle) Tj
T*
(theta.) Tj
T*
(Python Source Code:) Tj
T*
(import math) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Input circuit parameters) Tj
T*
(v_rms = float\(input\('Enter RMS Voltage \(Volts\): '\)\)) Tj
T*
(i_rms = float\(input\('Enter RMS Current \(Amperes\): '\)\)) Tj
T*
(theta_deg = float\(input\('Enter Phase Angle \(degrees, + for lag, - for lead\): '\)\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Convert angle to radians for trigonometric functions) Tj
T*
(theta_rad = math.radians\(theta_deg\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Electrical Power Computations) Tj
T*
(p_active = v_rms * i_rms * math.cos\(theta_rad\) # Watts) Tj
T*
(q_reactive = v_rms * i_rms * math.sin\(theta_rad\) # VAR) Tj
T*
(s_apparent = v_rms * i_rms # VA) Tj
T*
(power_factor = math.cos\(theta_rad\)) Tj
T*
(pf_nature = 'Lagging \(Inductive\)' if theta_deg > 0 else \('Leading \(Capacitive\)' if) Tj
T*
(theta_deg < 0 else 'Unity'\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Complex Impedance Calculation: Z = V / I) Tj
T*
ET

